    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to the underworld's Premier Tournament: &quot;Reaper's Ace&quot;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here is whats allowed: EVERYTHING! From in the nuts to honourable to backstabbing!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2412600/extras/20ea4790a9f60e775650910f693f00b4.avif?t=1753289151\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Greetings, unfortunate souls! It's me, Death, your friendly neighborhood Reaper, and I'm thrilled to announce my latest... hobby.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You see, the afterlife can get a bit repetitive, so I've spiced things up with a brand-new game: Reaper's Ace!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think you\u2019ve got what it takes to earn your place in Heaven, Hell, or the countless realms in between?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Well, you don\u2019t have much of a choice, do you? \ud83d\ude08</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2412600/extras/a0dbe12b80c0a253c3eb97922f151819.poster.avif?t=1753289151\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2412600/extras/a0dbe12b80c0a253c3eb97922f151819.webm?t=1753289151\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ready to get wrecked? the cozy way?!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >it's a top-down roguelike where every move you make could be your last (again). Each run is a rollercoaster ride through semi-procedural levels and a small and cute open word where the only thing standing between you and eternal glory (or doom) is your deck of cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2412600/extras/efd408cdab13caad9b6d2c9e5fb20243.poster.avif?t=1753289151\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2412600/extras/efd408cdab13caad9b6d2c9e5fb20243.webm?t=1753289151\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the ultimate underworld tournament in this top-down roguelike where the rules\u2014and your luck\u2014are always changing. Here\u2019s what awaits you in the afterlife:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb2 <strong>Puzzling Thrills</strong>: We are not just about dispatching competition here... we also have a vast number of puzzles to test your brains!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2412600/extras/905257eeee095b94cc5e42defbd6b767.poster.avif?t=1753289151\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2412600/extras/905257eeee095b94cc5e42defbd6b767.webm?t=1753289151\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udccf <strong>Deck of Destiny</strong>: Draw 4 random cards before each battle. Your spells are as unpredictable as your fate\u2014every encounter is a gamble!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc79 <strong>Boss Battles</strong>: Face off against unique bosses where your deck could make or break you. Will you conquer or be conquered?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Weapons Galore</strong>: Arm yourself with a variety of weapons to slay your foes... or die trying.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2412600/extras/cb9b72274880d4f58716f470482defe0.poster.avif?t=1753289151\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2412600/extras/cb9b72274880d4f58716f470482defe0.webm?t=1753289151\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude08 <strong>Death\u2019s Dynamic Dungeon</strong>: Death\u2019s still designing, so expect surprises! Rules and challenges might shift as you delve deeper.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc80 <strong>Lighthearted Chaos</strong>: It\u2019s all in good fun\u2014or at least, Death thinks so. Dark humor and unexpected twists keep the afterlife... entertaining.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So, ready or not, step into the arena, wield your weapons, draw your cards, and impress me! After all, a bit of entertainment is the least you can do for your old pal Death, right?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2412600/extras/d68f7a9e7529ea28533f47814cabb32c.avif?t=1753289151\" /></span>- Death, Lord of the Underworld and Unofficial Game Master of Reaper's Ace</p>",
